{"t":"COST","made":"2026-11-17 08:51","name":"Costco Wholesale Corporation","ko":"코스트코","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","employees":355000,"hq":"Issaquah, WA, United States","website":"https://www.costco.com","summary_en":"Costco Wholesale Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the operation of membership warehouses in the United States, Puerto Rico, Canada, Mexico, Japan, the United Kingdom, Korea, Australia, Taiwan, China, Spain, France, Sweden, Iceland, and New Zealand. It offers merchandise, including sundries, dry groceries, candies, coolers, freezers, liquor, and tobacco; non-food merchandise comprising consumer electronics, appliances, small electrics, health and beauty aids, hardware, lawn and garden, sporting goods, tires, toys and seasonal, automotive, stamps, tickets, apparel, furniture, domestics, housewares, special order kiosks, and jewelry; and fresh food, such as meat, produce, deli, and bakery products. The company is also involved in warehouse ancillary operations, which include gasoline, pharmacies, food courts, optical, hearing aids, and tire installation centers. In addition, it engages in e-commerce, business centers, travel, and other businesses. Further, the company operates e-commerce sites; and offers branded and private-label products in various categories. The company was formerly known as Costco Companies, Inc. and changed its name to Costco Wholesale Corporation in August 1999. Costco Wholesale Corporation was founded in 1976 and is based in Issaquah, Washington.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"코스트코 홀세일 코퍼레이션은 자회사들과 함께 미국, 푸에르토리코, 캐나다, 멕시코, 일본, 영국, 한국, 호주, 대만, 중국, 스페인, 프랑스, ​​스웨덴, 아이슬란드, 뉴질랜드에서 회원 창고 운영에 참여하고 있습니다. 잡화, 건조 식료품, 사탕, 쿨러, 냉동고, 주류 및 담배를 포함한 상품을 제공합니다. 가전제품, 가전제품, 소형 전기 제품, 건강 및 미용 보조기구, 하드웨어, 잔디 및 정원, 스포츠 용품, 타이어, 장난감 및 계절 상품, 자동차, 우표, 티켓, 의류, 가구, 가정용품, 가정용품, 특별 주문 키오스크 및 보석으로 구성된 비식품 상품; 육류, 농산물, 델리 및 베이커리 제품과 같은 신선한 식품. 이 회사는 또한 휘발유, 약국, 푸드 코트, 안경, 보청기 및 타이어 설치 센터를 포함한 창고 보조 운영에도 참여하고 있습니다. 또한 전자상거래, 비즈니스 센터, 여행 및 기타 사업에도 종사하고 있습니다. 또한 회사는 전자상거래 사이트를 운영하고 있습니다. 다양한 카테고리의 브랜드 및 자체 브랜드 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에는 Costco Companies, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 1999년 8월에 Costco Wholesale Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. Costco Wholesale Corporation은 1976년에 설립되었으며 워싱턴주 이사콰에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":1113.74,"mcap":493530873856.0,"pe":53.64836,"fpe":44.50988,"peg":5.5401,"ps":1.6279873,"pb":13.788859,"ev_ebitda":33.773,"div":0.53,"beta":0.852,"hi52":1117.0,"lo52":844.06},"fin":{"rev":303154003968.0,"rev_g":0.111,"eps_g":0.15,"gross":0.12765999,"op":0.03797,"net":0.03043,"roe":0.28402,"fcf":6752750080.0,"cash":21301000192.0,"debt":10181000192.0,"de":28.436,"eps":20.76,"feps":25.02231},"own":{"short":0.0178,"inst":0.74200994,"insider":0.00227},"analyst":{"n":37,"mean":1080.7567,"median":1100.0,"high":1315.0,"low":770.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.97561,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":20,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":21,"hold":13,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":20,"hold":13,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":19,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":1155.0,"priorPriceTarget":1143.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":1150.0,"priorPriceTarget":1015.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"CICC","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":1050.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Tigress Financial","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":1250.0,"priorPriceTarget":1065.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm"